    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be292856d0cd1b8c0eb61fcd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她至今还是无败，所以这种情况理所当然吧。\n大家都在期待着她——不过。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23ac1b352419020c0571ee077ac292c428058110f9fd216a4ec1c0c2b44e27c3",
