      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没什么好怕的。米浴同学可是有能跟那位\n话题赛马娘匹敌的实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f848c42cfb9a2f555a10972ca9aa3e3a4813c06a76ca71dd3526f0c07ae59e36",
