    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7f80f834ca0868845078eb7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我也要！　请在蛋包饭上用番茄酱\n可爱地写上『美浦波旁』吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b702fd408979678d26b20168d1689774de25e24a7be6fe6d992d6f201911bdc",
