      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然米浴上次又输给了美浦波旁，\n但是差距比德比那时还要小。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ceb7cdc28f3bf0de52b64efee4caa914482cf8a558f81ee608e342b9b179f7b1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
