    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:104411ee77ed7e67f8f76e18",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "米浴想早点跟美浦波旁同学再跑一场。\n一直都在期待着呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c53d26c4f271f1287b7249aa39869e4742e3d5737ab807ccbc2b4a05cd59fe1b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0002/storytimeline_020002051.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f04a0cb17713df266713b3c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "米浴对比赛感到的，不再是不安——\n而是期待，这就是她成长的证据。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4c37c0c1808cb813acd307139672eff077ddc364dfcd551acdd0d103fecbc72",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0002/storytimeline_020002051.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        46,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/46/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2661558dc69948f2bae88a5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
